.TH SHADERCANDY-PLAYER 1 "2026-09-20" "ShaderCandy 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shadercandy-player \- standalone shader player with interactive controls
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shadercandy-player
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shadercandy-player
is a standalone GLFW-based shader player with interactive keyboard controls,
crossfade transitions, shuffle mode, and audio reactivity.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-shader " path"
Start with a specific shader file.
.TP
.BI \-dir " path"
Add a shader directory.
.TP
.B \-audio
Enable audio reactivity.
.TP
.B \-w\fR, \fB\-\-width " pixels"
Set window width (default: 1280).
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-height " pixels"
Set window height (default: 720).
.SH KEYBOARD CONTROLS
.TP
.B Right Arrow / Space / P / Tab
Next shader (with crossfade transition).
.TP
.B Left Arrow / N
Previous shader.
.TP
.B S
Toggle shuffle mode.
.TP
.B X
Skip current shader.
.TP
.B F / F11
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
.B R
Force recompile and reload.
.TP
.B D
Toggle debug overlay.
.TP
.B ESC
Quit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shadercandy-screensaver (1),
.BR shadercandy-wallpaper (1),
.BR shadercandy-wayland (1)
.SH AUTHORS
ShaderCandy contributors.
